## Escalation doctrine

On any **CRITICAL** finding:

1. **Stop** feature development.  
2. Report **ROOT CAUSE**, **IMPACT**, **FILES AFFECTED**, **RECOMMENDED FIX**.  
3. Continue only after user acknowledgment or explicit override.

Repository integrity beats shipping features. Prevent dog-breakfast architecture.
